                "<button onclick='draw_triangle(`triangle1`, `%A1%`, `%B1%`, `%C1%`, `%a1%`, `%b1%`, `%c1%`)'>Show picture</button>",
                "Note: picture not drawn to scale<br>",
                "Find the area of the triangle"
            ],
            "Answer": [
                "%A%"
            ],
            "Explanation": [
                "`%si1% = %s1v%`",
                "`%si2% = %s2v%`",
                "`%si3% = %s3v%`",
                "Heron's formula:",
                "`Area = sqrt(s(s-%si1%)(s-%si2%)(s-%si3%))`",
                "`s = (%si1%+%si2%+%si3%)/2`",
                "`s = (%s1v%+%s2v%+%s3v%)/2`",
                "`s = %s%`",
                "`Area = sqrt(%s%(%s%-%s1v%)(%s%-%s2v%)(%s%-%s3v%))`",
                "`Area = %A%`"
            ]
        }
